@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE

title Mango 服务启动与注册时序图

actor "运维人员" as Ops
participant "Consul\n:8500" as Consul
participant "mango-monitor\n:8000" as Monitor
participant "mango-admin\n:8001" as Admin
participant "mango-backup\n:8002" as Backup
participant "mango-producer\n:8004" as Producer
participant "mango-consumer\n:8005" as Consumer
database "MySQL" as DB

== 启动阶段 ==

Ops -> Consul : 1. consul agent -dev
activate Consul
Consul --> Ops : Consul 启动成功
deactivate Consul

Ops -> Monitor : 2. 启动监控服务
activate Monitor
Monitor -> Consul : 3. 注册到 Consul
activate Consul
Consul --> Monitor : 注册成功
deactivate Consul
Monitor --> Ops : 监控服务启动 (端口 8000)
deactivate Monitor

Ops -> Admin : 4. 启动管理服务
activate Admin
Admin -> Consul : 5. 注册到 Consul
activate Consul
Consul --> Admin : 注册成功
deactivate Consul
Admin -> DB : 6. 连接数据库
activate DB
DB --> Admin : 连接成功
deactivate DB
Admin --> Ops : 管理服务启动 (端口 8001)
deactivate Admin

== 监控发现阶段 ==

Monitor -> Consul : 7. 定时拉取服务列表
activate Consul
Consul --> Monitor : mango-admin, mango-backup...
deactivate Consul

Monitor -> Admin : 8. 健康检查 (GET /actuator/health)
activate Admin
Admin --> Monitor : 200 OK { "status": "UP" }
deactivate Admin

Monitor -> Backup : 9. 健康检查 (GET /actuator/health)
activate Backup
Backup --> Monitor : 200 OK { "status": "UP" }
deactivate Backup

Monitor -> Producer : 10. 健康检查 (GET /actuator/health)
activate Producer
Producer --> Monitor : 200 OK { "status": "UP" }
deactivate Producer

Monitor -> Consumer : 11. 健康检查 (GET /actuator/health)
activate Consumer
Consumer --> Monitor : 200 OK { "status": "UP" }
deactivate Consumer

== 监控展示 ==

Ops -> Monitor : 12. 访问 http://localhost:8000
activate Monitor
Monitor --> Ops : 展示所有服务状态
deactivate Monitor

@enduml
